-- Migration number: 0044
--
-- Search finds names however they are punctuated. Each name is indexed as
-- before (apostrophes removed, 0009) and, when different, squashed as well:
-- punctuation and spaces taken out and $ read as s. So "K.A.A.N." is found
-- by "kaan", "AC/DC" by "acdc", "blink-182" by "blink182" and "A$AP Rocky"
-- by "asap". src/lib/search.ts squashes typed text the same way.
--
-- Generated (the expression is long): every trigger that writes the index
-- is replaced with one using it, and the index is rebuilt.

